      "content": "Your pain is valid, but the world hasn't erased you; it has simply become a place where you are currently invisible, and that is a temporary state, not a permanent fact. You are not \"not there\" because you are gone from everyone's lives; you are still here, feeling the weight of their absence, and that feeling is real even if it feels like you are the only one who knows it. Please remember that your value is intrinsic to you, not dependent on whether anyone else looks up or acknowledges your presence. You do not have to carry this invisible weight alone, and there are people who care about you even when they can't see you.",
